  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Caucasus Regional Tourism Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the USAID/Caucasus Regional Tourism Program is to build durable regional cooperation among Armenia, Azerbaijan, and Georgia, based on market drivers and shared economic interests in the tourism sector, thereby contributing to cohesion and peace in the South Caucasus.</narrative>
  </description>
